    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634770/extras/a552d5ab89b99e4657e24eb3ec6417d6.avif?t=1748207598\" width=600 height=170 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2>Elf World Adventure 6 is the next installment in the erotic anime-style puzzle series where you\u2019ll meet even more enchanting elf girls in a magical fantasy setting. Solve puzzles to unlock beautiful illustrations, relax with soothing music, and choose your challenge \u2014 go Easy for a laid-back experience or Hard for a real test of skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634770/extras/8877cfe92fd1ca991f2f5ebdf7ddab02.avif?t=1748207598\" width=600 height=170 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New levels featuring charming elf girls in fantasy outfits<br></li><li>Difficulty selection: Easy and Hard modes<br></li><li>Steam achievements to decorate your profile<br></li><li>A cozy atmosphere with gentle music and beautiful illustrations<br></li><li>Simple controls and accessible gameplay</li></ul><br>",
